# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — unalz 0.65 ALZ 解压 CLI 适配链（Makefile 硬编码编译器 / musl iconv 韩文文件名 / 最小 ALZ 夹具） ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-21
# Software: unalz 0.65
# Gate: <待填：PR 号 / CI build 号>
# Status: DRAFT — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry
#
